# Private maintainer instructions and generated dependencies stay local.
/rust/AGENTS.md
**/node_modules/

# Studio regenerates its translation prompts on every translation run.
**/translations/TRANSLATION-CODEBOT.md
**/translations/TRANSLATION-CHATBOT.md
**/translations/CODEX_TRANSLATION.md

# Managed translation projects keep source text in state/source.json.
# These Studio export and handoff files are regenerated when needed.
**/translations/manifest.json
**/translations/TRANSLATION-WORKSET.json
**/translations/TRANSLATION-RESULT.json
**/translations/*.en.doc.json
